  "title": "1915 Land Use, Hyderabad and Secunderabad",
  "description": "'Land Use Map of Hyderabad and Secunderabad in 1915 AD', scale 1:67,000 (approximate), with six classes: residential, commercial, public and semi-public, parks and play ground, burials and cremation grounds, agriculture. The drawing is not to scale, so it is fitted to 11 points that still exist (railway stations, Hussain Sagar, Mir Alam tank, Golconda, Puranapul) and bent between them; expect offsets of a few hundred metres away from those points.",
